================ B. ARTEFACT DECOMPOSITION ================
  The harness adds white noise over the whole 0-24 kHz Nyquist band. Real
  hardware has an anti-alias filter and a band-limited transducer, so its
  out-of-band bins are not filled with noise in the same way. The acquisition
  band below is applied to signal AND noise together at constant noise power
  spectral density, so the in-band SNR is identical in every row and the only
  thing that changes is how much out-of-band noise the front end sees.
  acquisition band 0-24 kHz (as simulated) ...
